--[[
    H-HUB // BLOX FRUITS COMPANION v2.0
    Client-side companion dashboard for Roblox.

    Included:
      * Responsive, draggable neon UI + RightShift show/hide
      * Level / health / equipped-tool / quest HUD
      * Nearby enemy radar + optional local Highlight markers
      * Halloween 2026 event-object scanner (read-only)
      * Low-effects mode with restoration when disabled / closed
      * Optional auto-equip of the first available Tool
      * Safe cleanup when the GUI is closed

    This version deliberately does NOT forge combat remotes, hook __namecall,
    move server-owned enemies, or bypass game validation. It is suitable as a
    LocalScript in a Roblox experience you own, and uses ordinary client APIs.
]]

